<title>UK: TABLE-Bank of Scotland yr profit up 22 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bank of Scotland yr profit up 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 28, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 31.6		  vs 25.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   5.31		 vs 4.40</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   8.22		 vs 6.85</p>
<p> Pretax		     664.1		  vs 545.0</p>
<p> Pre-provision profit   825.5		  vs 706.0</p>
<p> Cost/income ratio	 52.5		  vs  52.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 640.00 and 660.00 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Bank of Scotland.</p>
</text>
